WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — rce-vc (60s) AI-synthesized studio narration

1
00:00:00.951 --> 00:00:04.673
Traditional version control tracks text lines and filenames,

2
00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:09.326
turning harmless re-orderings or parallel agent patches into manual merges.

3
00:00:11.603 --> 00:00:14.615
Each submission runs against a named admission check:

4
00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:19.218
either it joins the single name-free state, or a structured refusal explains why.

5
00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:25.610
Because dependencies reference content keys rather than mutable paths,

6
00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:29.313
disjoint agent swarms commit concurrently without branch locks.

7
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:36.202
At commit aba99fce, 49 offline tests pass across core,

8
00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:42.179
keys, and Git projection, scaling cleanly to 100,000 repository units.

9
00:00:44.456 --> 00:00:47.460
RCE-VC requires no RCE source code,

10
00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:54.154
and transparently pairs M5 Max L3 reported_j with stated est_uj receipt costs.
